$ Python library: CuPy
@ CuPy

CuPY provided GPU-accelerated computing. The library uses CUDA Toolkit libraries including
  • cuBLAS
  • cuRAND
  • cuSOLVER
  • cuSPARSE
  • cuFFT
  • cuDNN
  • NCCL

code {
# For CUDA 12.x
pip install cupy-cuda12x

# For CUDA 13.x
pip install cupy-cuda13x

# For AMD ROCm 7.0
pip install cupy-rocm-7-0
code }

